WEBVTT

00:00:19.680 --> 00:00:24.250
Gio, what are you doing? Give me a hand. Here.

00:00:24.250 --> 00:00:26.090
O-Okay.

00:00:26.090 --> 00:00:29.690
You stretch the sheets out like
this to get rid of the wrinkles.

00:00:29.690 --> 00:00:31.490
You try it.

00:00:31.490 --> 00:00:33.090
Like this?

00:00:34.160 --> 00:00:36.460
Gio! Not like that!

00:00:36.460 --> 00:00:39.330
- S-Sorry.
- Geez...

00:00:39.330 --> 00:00:41.960
What are you doing, Gio?

00:01:07.160 --> 00:01:10.390
Jin... Toa...

00:01:13.840 --> 00:01:17.140
I know.

00:01:17.140 --> 00:01:21.970
I know. I'm... no longer...

00:01:49.170 --> 00:01:54.880
Osanai hi ni nakushita

00:01:54.880 --> 00:02:00.750
sono itami no imi sae

00:02:00.750 --> 00:02:06.520
Uzumakumatte takushita

00:02:06.520 --> 00:02:09.720
Boku wa kitto...

00:02:11.090 --> 00:02:17.430
Ao no hate ni mita yokan wo toraete

00:02:17.430 --> 00:02:24.970
kaze ni nori hikari no sasu hou e

00:02:24.970 --> 00:02:27.810
I'll always be with you

00:02:27.810 --> 00:02:30.450
see the sky in front of you

00:02:30.450 --> 00:02:34.810
fly high in a light from the deepest blue

00:02:36.550 --> 00:02:41.990
Uzumaku hoshi no hibiki ni nosete

00:02:41.990 --> 00:02:44.660
utau yo

00:02:44.660 --> 00:02:53.330
Kono koe ga kimi ni todokimasu you ni

00:03:27.300 --> 00:03:29.130
It's so cold...

00:03:40.350 --> 00:03:45.890
I'm sorry, Sigelinde. I...

00:03:45.890 --> 00:03:48.120
...am going to die soon.

00:03:52.190 --> 00:03:58.000
It's not fair. It just isn't fair, Toa.

00:03:58.000 --> 00:03:59.730
Toa...

00:04:03.840 --> 00:04:05.500
Dummy.

00:04:18.050 --> 00:04:21.420
What is the matter, Young Miss?

00:04:21.420 --> 00:04:24.190
It's nothing, Amadeus.

00:04:24.190 --> 00:04:26.490
The sun was just a bit too bright, that's all.

00:04:26.490 --> 00:04:32.370
I am about to make some tea.
Or would you prefer coffee, instead?

00:04:32.370 --> 00:04:37.110
Tea is fine. By the way, where are the others?

00:04:37.110 --> 00:04:41.880
Raina-sama and Habaragi-sama
are down on the beach.

00:04:41.880 --> 00:04:46.680
Thanatos' successor...
I wonder what that means, exactly.

00:04:46.680 --> 00:04:48.920
Howling Star and the others don't know, either.

00:04:48.920 --> 00:04:51.890
Which makes this extremely interesting.

00:04:51.890 --> 00:04:57.290
It could be that Gio is in direct
contact with Thanatos' mind.

00:04:57.290 --> 00:05:01.260
Do you think that's why Gio's
attitude changed so suddenly?

00:05:01.260 --> 00:05:06.130
He lived peacefully with Jin and Toa for a year.

00:05:06.130 --> 00:05:09.140
I can't think of any other reason.

00:05:09.140 --> 00:05:13.780
He's probably a whole different
Gio now from the one we know.

00:05:13.780 --> 00:05:19.950
I'll bet he's become the instrument
to carry out the will of Thanatos.

00:05:19.950 --> 00:05:25.420
Almost like a wild animal.
"Survival of the fittest," you might call it.

00:05:25.420 --> 00:05:28.420
Hm, that has a somewhat different meaning.

00:05:28.420 --> 00:05:32.560
In this case, it's more like thinning the herd.

00:05:32.560 --> 00:05:34.500
That's an icky expression.

00:05:34.500 --> 00:05:36.900
You're saying that in order
to maintain the species,

00:05:36.900 --> 00:05:41.240
it's only allowing the most
superior specimens to remain?

00:05:41.240 --> 00:05:43.470
Who can tell?

00:05:43.470 --> 00:05:46.310
We don't even know a hundredth
as much about Thanatos

00:05:46.310 --> 00:05:48.830
as we do about that hermit crab.

00:05:52.980 --> 00:05:55.980
And the Dragons aren't that much different.

00:05:55.980 --> 00:06:01.360
Mankind only ever thought
of using them as weapons.

00:06:01.360 --> 00:06:06.860
We never earnestly even tried
to consider who they might be.

00:06:06.860 --> 00:06:09.200
Taking upon ourselves the role of masters,

00:06:09.200 --> 00:06:12.770
without knowing anything about them.

00:06:12.770 --> 00:06:14.940
Hey, you two!

00:06:14.940 --> 00:06:18.510
Enough with the gloom and doom
so early in the morning.

00:06:18.510 --> 00:06:20.340
How about some tea?

00:06:27.650 --> 00:06:34.190
Kitajima-kun, there's something
that I have to tell you.

00:06:34.190 --> 00:06:39.360
We're all falling apart, little by little.

00:06:39.360 --> 00:06:42.860
There's something missing,
something we're lacking.

00:06:42.860 --> 00:06:45.500
As such, we seek it.

00:06:45.500 --> 00:06:49.740
But going through Resonance
with the Dragons fulfills that wish,

00:06:49.740 --> 00:06:52.540
and gives it form.

00:06:52.540 --> 00:06:56.580
We try to make it compensate
for what we're missing.

00:06:56.580 --> 00:07:01.320
I'm sure that Thanatos is angry.
Its precious children

00:07:01.320 --> 00:07:04.820
have been contaminated by
the selfish desires of mankind.

00:07:04.820 --> 00:07:08.560
So it's trying to get rid of
those who don't measure up.

00:07:08.560 --> 00:07:11.060
For a creature that wanders between stars,

00:07:11.060 --> 00:07:14.760
devouring worlds as it goes,

00:07:14.760 --> 00:07:18.200
aren't you making out its principles
of conduct to be a little too human?

00:07:18.200 --> 00:07:19.870
I know.

00:07:19.870 --> 00:07:24.410
It's all in my imagination.
But I can't help it, you know?

00:07:24.410 --> 00:07:30.880
That's the extent of what my tiny
human brain is able to consider.

00:07:30.880 --> 00:07:33.780
- Young Miss...
- What?

00:07:33.780 --> 00:07:36.510
There is someone over there.

00:07:44.190 --> 00:07:46.180
L-Laura...

00:07:52.530 --> 00:07:56.870
As I expected, the anti-Thanatos
factor has established itself

00:07:56.870 --> 00:08:00.270
in an active state within the
subject's cellular structure.

00:08:00.270 --> 00:08:03.110
If we introduce it into Thanatos in this state,

00:08:03.110 --> 00:08:06.980
I believe it will produce the
effect that we are hoping for.

00:08:10.720 --> 00:08:12.490
It is the Raum, after all.

00:08:12.490 --> 00:08:15.420
That's what the scientists say.

00:08:15.420 --> 00:08:18.760
Then, where is the Raum that Nozaki dumped?

00:08:24.630 --> 00:08:29.340
That was the Raum, too. But it
was apparently a cast-off shell.

00:08:29.340 --> 00:08:30.910
A shell?

00:08:30.910 --> 00:08:34.680
As Communicators, you normally keep

00:08:34.680 --> 00:08:37.850
your Dragon bodies in hyperspace.

00:08:37.850 --> 00:08:41.650
But after the Raum went through
Resonance with Commander Sakaki,

00:08:41.650 --> 00:08:45.320
that connection was broken, for some reason.

00:08:45.320 --> 00:08:47.620
Is that sort of thing possible?

00:08:47.620 --> 00:08:51.520
This is your kind we're
talking about. Don't you know?

00:08:55.530 --> 00:08:57.590
Dad!

00:09:01.640 --> 00:09:03.870
Are you going to launch her into Thanatos,

00:09:03.870 --> 00:09:06.440
as the Annihilator's warhead?

00:09:06.440 --> 00:09:10.180
The Raum is an Original that was
sent here directly from Thanatos.

00:09:10.180 --> 00:09:13.610
The anti-Thanatos factor did take hold.

00:09:15.950 --> 00:09:19.320
This will put an end to everything!

00:09:19.320 --> 00:09:23.360
Thanatos, Jin, everything.

00:09:23.360 --> 00:09:25.560
It will all be over.

00:09:25.560 --> 00:09:27.460
Over!

00:09:29.530 --> 00:09:35.670
The time that I have left
is about to come to an end.

00:09:35.670 --> 00:09:37.830
I know.

00:09:42.510 --> 00:09:45.670
There's something I want you to see.

00:09:50.850 --> 00:09:52.820
What's that?

00:09:52.820 --> 00:09:56.690
It's a harbinger of death
that appears on Dragons

00:09:56.690 --> 00:09:58.430
whose lives are running out.

00:09:58.430 --> 00:10:03.360
But Dragons are so much
stronger than humans...

00:10:03.360 --> 00:10:06.500
We are probes.

00:10:06.500 --> 00:10:08.600
Probes?

00:10:08.600 --> 00:10:13.240
The Album, the Raum, and myself.

00:10:13.240 --> 00:10:16.780
From the beginning, on the day
that Thanatos sent us to Earth,

00:10:16.780 --> 00:10:22.350
we have been living lives that were limited.

00:10:22.350 --> 00:10:26.350
We were created only to bring the Dragons

00:10:26.350 --> 00:10:30.020
that remained on this world back to Thanatos.

00:10:30.020 --> 00:10:32.890
In other words, we were disposable goods.

00:10:32.890 --> 00:10:35.960
No, that's just horrible!

00:10:35.960 --> 00:10:38.530
You mustn't judge the actions of Thanatos

00:10:38.530 --> 00:10:42.300
with your human-centric values, Yuri.

00:10:42.300 --> 00:10:44.310
Professor...

00:10:44.310 --> 00:10:47.580
Thanatos is a being that
transcends human understanding.

00:10:47.580 --> 00:10:52.710
Its emotions and will are both on
a level far different from humans.

00:10:52.710 --> 00:10:55.250
You must not forget that.

00:10:55.250 --> 00:10:57.950
We're not grown up enough to
be able to say, "oh, you don't say,"

00:10:57.950 --> 00:10:59.950
and just accept something like that.

00:10:59.950 --> 00:11:03.790
Humans are not like Dragons.

00:11:03.790 --> 00:11:09.830
Toa's life will come to an end soon.

00:11:09.830 --> 00:11:16.070
I am able to save you, now that
I have become Thanatos' successor.

00:11:16.070 --> 00:11:17.630
Toa!

00:11:28.950 --> 00:11:30.450
What can I...

00:11:30.450 --> 00:11:33.420
What can I do,

00:11:33.420 --> 00:11:35.620
Toa?

00:11:35.620 --> 00:11:38.590
Get up, you two, quickly!

00:11:38.590 --> 00:11:40.150
What is it?

00:11:42.830 --> 00:11:45.630
Huh? Commander Sakaki?!

00:11:52.770 --> 00:11:57.180
So then, knowing that it was
the Raum that had taken the form

00:11:57.180 --> 00:12:00.050
of your long-dead daughter,
you kept on hiding her?

00:12:00.050 --> 00:12:02.480
You kept it a secret,

00:12:02.480 --> 00:12:06.620
and went on playing the Dragonauts
commander as if nothing had happened.

00:12:06.620 --> 00:12:09.620
Why exactly did you do it?
I can understand how you'd want to have

00:12:09.620 --> 00:12:12.860
the Raum close at hand, taking
the place of your daughter, but...

00:12:12.860 --> 00:12:15.630
No, she is not Laura!

00:12:15.630 --> 00:12:18.870
She is a counterfeit, created by my mind.

00:12:18.870 --> 00:12:23.060
I'm not about to let Laura be a Dragon!

00:12:43.320 --> 00:12:47.830
The Dragon that killed
Laura even stole her form.

00:12:47.830 --> 00:12:50.260
I was not going to stand for it.

00:12:57.170 --> 00:12:59.340
- Jin...
- And so...

00:12:59.340 --> 00:13:01.880
...you plotted revenge against Thanatos.

00:13:01.880 --> 00:13:04.570
You were going to use us
Dragonauts as your instrument.

00:13:25.900 --> 00:13:28.270
The signal from Deep Eye has been lost!

00:13:28.270 --> 00:13:29.640
Ryoko, what's the cause?

00:13:29.640 --> 00:13:32.310
Analyzing. But just before we were cut off,

00:13:32.310 --> 00:13:36.110
a massive energy emission
from Thanatos was recorded.

00:13:36.110 --> 00:13:38.880
Is this pattern a Doppler shift?

00:13:38.880 --> 00:13:42.820
You mean, Thanatos has moved?
Then, what is its current position?

00:13:42.820 --> 00:13:45.920
I don't know. It's actually
been over an hour since

00:13:45.920 --> 00:13:48.220
Deep Eye stopped functioning, after all.

00:13:48.220 --> 00:13:49.990
Thanatos has vanished?

00:13:49.990 --> 00:13:52.930
It might be coming to Earth.

00:13:54.130 --> 00:13:57.970
For crying out loud, that sound is echoing
in my head right through to the center.

00:13:57.970 --> 00:14:00.500
- Captain!
- Ryoko-kun.

00:14:00.500 --> 00:14:04.670
Connect us to the deep space
whole-sky scanning system at once.

00:14:04.670 --> 00:14:06.570
Confirm Thanatos' position!

00:14:06.570 --> 00:14:08.010
Y-Yes, sir.

00:14:08.010 --> 00:14:12.480
Saki-kun, patch us through to ISDA
headquarters, highest priority.

00:14:12.480 --> 00:14:14.620
Acknowledged.

00:14:14.620 --> 00:14:17.450
- Megumi-kun...
- Yes?

00:14:17.450 --> 00:14:22.410
Black coffee. Make it a tall one, good and hot.

00:14:24.960 --> 00:14:26.590
Huh?

00:14:27.760 --> 00:14:29.660
Yes, sir.

00:14:36.340 --> 00:14:38.100
I...

00:14:42.540 --> 00:14:45.510
Still, after Gio went out of
control and leveled Mars,

00:14:45.510 --> 00:14:48.980
you reversed yourself, and tried
to capture the Dragonauts.

00:14:48.980 --> 00:14:53.490
You became fearful of the power
that Dragons possess, Commander.

00:14:53.490 --> 00:14:56.560
Laura possesses the abilities of a Dragon.

00:14:56.560 --> 00:14:59.990
Worst of all, she does whatever you say.

00:14:59.990 --> 00:15:03.700
So, you set up the Exford Force for her.

00:15:03.700 --> 00:15:07.900
She was the perfect tool for hunting you down.

00:15:07.900 --> 00:15:09.840
Little man.

00:15:09.840 --> 00:15:14.340
Right now, ISDA is implanting
an anti-Thanatos factor in her,

00:15:14.340 --> 00:15:17.410
and stuffing her into a
missile warhead or something.

00:15:17.410 --> 00:15:19.710
It's ironic.

00:15:19.710 --> 00:15:24.080
The trump card that can defeat Thanatos

00:15:24.080 --> 00:15:27.020
has been next to me all along.

00:15:27.020 --> 00:15:29.590
Are you saying that Laura knew all of this,

00:15:29.590 --> 00:15:32.060
and was letting herself be used?

00:15:32.060 --> 00:15:34.430
That's right.

00:15:34.430 --> 00:15:39.030
I don't want to be worried over.

00:15:39.030 --> 00:15:44.440
That's how you feel too, right?

00:15:44.440 --> 00:15:48.910
She was desperate to be
of some use to you. And yet...

00:15:48.910 --> 00:15:53.910
I told you, she was a tool.
You understand, don't you?

00:15:53.910 --> 00:15:57.510
As someone else who lost your
loved ones in that accident?

00:16:01.620 --> 00:16:04.690
Are you happy now?

00:16:04.690 --> 00:16:06.190
What?

00:16:06.190 --> 00:16:08.600
You're making the Dragon
that killed your daughter suffer

00:16:08.600 --> 00:16:11.300
and carry out your revenge against Thanatos.

00:16:11.300 --> 00:16:13.470
Is that what you wanted?

00:16:13.470 --> 00:16:16.940
Of course. What else is there?

00:16:16.940 --> 00:16:18.970
In that case...

00:16:18.970 --> 00:16:22.740
In that case, why do you look so bitter?

00:16:25.380 --> 00:16:28.580
You should have been saved
when you found Laura,

00:16:28.580 --> 00:16:31.450
the way I was saved when I found Toa.

00:16:31.450 --> 00:16:35.460
Don't be ridiculous! I was...

00:16:35.460 --> 00:16:38.130
Run, Dad!

00:16:38.130 --> 00:16:39.590
I was...

00:16:39.590 --> 00:16:42.760
It was true for us, too, Commander.

00:16:42.760 --> 00:16:44.670
Howling Star is my partner.

00:16:44.670 --> 00:16:46.770
Otohime is another me.

00:16:46.770 --> 00:16:49.170
Amadeus is a dear family member.

00:16:49.170 --> 00:16:51.970
We want someone to turn to us.

00:16:51.970 --> 00:16:56.140
We want to be needed.
Nobody can stand being alone.

00:16:56.140 --> 00:16:59.440
That's what Resonance is, isn't it?

00:17:26.340 --> 00:17:28.000
Gio...

00:17:35.450 --> 00:17:38.020
Dragon, who was chosen to be the successor,

00:17:38.020 --> 00:17:39.990
have you come to follow your destiny

00:17:39.990 --> 00:17:42.290
and consign everyone else to oblivion?

00:17:42.290 --> 00:17:43.790
Destiny?

00:17:43.790 --> 00:17:47.130
It is a trial, given to the one
who would succeed Thanatos.

00:17:47.130 --> 00:17:53.000
Herd-thinning? Pretty narrow
thinking, considering its size.

00:17:53.000 --> 00:17:55.670
- Professor!
- H-Hey...

00:17:55.670 --> 00:17:58.870
Gio's power has increased.

00:17:58.870 --> 00:18:02.580
Thanatos has shared some
of its power directly with him.

00:18:02.580 --> 00:18:06.210
Both of you, run! Gio is after the eggs.

00:18:06.210 --> 00:18:08.720
There's no need for you to get
caught in the middle of this.

00:18:08.720 --> 00:18:11.880
- But...
- We won't make it, Professor.

00:18:24.670 --> 00:18:26.260
What was that?

00:18:28.840 --> 00:18:30.860
Stop it, Gio!

00:18:36.410 --> 00:18:39.050
Let's go!

00:18:39.050 --> 00:18:40.740
Actualize!

00:18:43.780 --> 00:18:46.050
Just you wait, Jin!

00:18:58.800 --> 00:19:00.230
It's not working!

00:19:00.230 --> 00:19:03.690
This is the power of Thanatos' successor?

00:19:15.820 --> 00:19:17.280
Gio!

00:19:17.280 --> 00:19:23.060
Stop this, already! There's no reason
why we have to fight, is there?!

00:19:23.060 --> 00:19:25.490
Then fight me...

00:19:25.490 --> 00:19:27.150
...Jin!

00:19:36.000 --> 00:19:40.470
Wait, Kazuki! This is no
time for me to fight you!

00:19:40.470 --> 00:19:42.100
Get him.

00:19:45.350 --> 00:19:47.510
If it weren't for you!

00:19:50.520 --> 00:19:53.120
Toa!

00:19:53.120 --> 00:19:54.820
Get up, Toa!

00:19:54.820 --> 00:19:57.960
If you hadn't gone through Resonance with Jin,

00:19:57.960 --> 00:20:00.290
Kazuki would not have had to suffer.

00:20:00.290 --> 00:20:02.600
Stop!

00:20:02.600 --> 00:20:04.190
Out of my way.

00:20:07.100 --> 00:20:08.660
Jin!

00:20:13.110 --> 00:20:16.610
- Toa!
- Stand there and watch, Kamishina Jin.

00:20:16.610 --> 00:20:18.710
I will destroy all...

00:20:18.710 --> 00:20:20.550
S-Stop!

00:20:20.550 --> 00:20:23.140
...who hurt Kazuki.

00:20:42.000 --> 00:20:44.990
- Gio...
- Look.

00:20:49.410 --> 00:20:50.640
What's that?

00:20:50.640 --> 00:20:53.680
Reading an unusual mass in the Moon's orbit!

00:20:53.680 --> 00:20:55.380
What is that?!

00:20:55.380 --> 00:20:57.040
It's...

00:21:07.030 --> 00:21:08.650
Thanatos?!

00:21:12.070 --> 00:21:15.870
It can't be... This suddenly?

00:21:15.870 --> 00:21:18.340
It's finally come, has it?

00:21:18.340 --> 00:21:20.170
Thanatos...

00:21:20.170 --> 00:21:23.010
Jin, give me Toa.

00:21:26.280 --> 00:21:30.720
It is the only way to save Toa.

00:21:30.720 --> 00:21:32.550
Gio...

00:22:19.470 --> 00:22:21.740
Hakisuteta kotoba no imi sae

00:22:21.740 --> 00:22:24.000
fukaku kangaetari wa shinai

00:22:24.000 --> 00:22:28.340
ima wo tada nigekiru dake

00:22:28.340 --> 00:22:30.610
Mata nannimo nakatta you ni

00:22:30.610 --> 00:22:32.750
onaji koto wo kurikaeshite'ru

00:22:32.750 --> 00:22:36.420
Muimi nano yo mata sonna nige

00:22:36.420 --> 00:22:45.290
Kekkyoku youchi de kodomo no manma da ne

00:22:45.290 --> 00:22:54.700
Hitori yogari kako no jibun wa mou sute na

00:22:54.700 --> 00:22:59.210
Tadashii tatakai wa
sou kimi no naka de hajimaru

00:22:59.210 --> 00:23:03.640
Kimi nara dou suru? Mou girigiri ja nai?

00:23:03.640 --> 00:23:08.720
Houkai shite shimau mae ni arubeki sugata wo

00:23:08.720 --> 00:23:15.820
omoiokoshite mite mi na yo

00:23:15.820 --> 00:23:21.950
Fight or flight

00:23:24.630 --> 00:23:29.400
Fight or flight

00:23:42.380 --> 00:23:44.890
This is a bulletin from ISDA.

00:23:44.890 --> 00:23:47.190
As a result of the huge blow
to specialty industries

00:23:47.190 --> 00:23:49.490
caused by the large-scale
destruction in Akihabara,

00:23:49.490 --> 00:23:53.430
it is doubtful that a certain
upcoming manga festival will be held.

